# PR Template

- Always use `.github/pull_request_template.md`. Keep its section headings, order, checklist items, and prompts.
- Never check **I have tested these changes in-game**. That box is reserved for a human after Retail QA. Leave it unchecked even if automated tests passed, even if CI requires other checklist items, and even if a previous PR checked it.
- Do not check **WoW Client Type** boxes as a substitute for in-game testing.
- In **Testing**, report automated and static validation actually run. State clearly that manual in-game QA was not performed when it was not.
- Do not claim in-game verification, and do not fabricate screenshots or videos as Retail proof.
- Treat **I've linked this PR to any related issues** as optional. Check other applicable checklist items.
- `.github/scripts/validate_pr_template.py` skips the in-game testing and linked-issue items so agents can leave those unchecked without failing CI.
